isional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m089-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAAC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p114","text":"悼公周者，其大父捷，晉襄公少子也，不得立，號爲桓叔，桓叔最愛。桓叔生惠伯談，談生悼公周。周之立，年十四矣。悼公曰：「大父、父皆不得立而辟難於周，客死焉。寡人自以疎遠，毋幾爲君。今大夫不忘文、襄之意而惠立桓叔之後，賴宗廟大夫之靈，得奉晉祀，豈敢不戰戰乎？大夫其亦佐寡人！」於是逐不臣者七人，修舊功，施德惠，收文公入時功臣後。秋，伐鄭。鄭師敗，遂至陳。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"悼公周","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"捷","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"晉襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"桓叔","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"惠伯談","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"談","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0040","start":40,"end":43,"surface":"悼公周","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m114-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"周","kind":"person","person_i